{
  "schema": 1,
  "split": "holdout-v2",
  "provenance": "Hand-labelled unrelated business API and transport controls; synthetic, not captured products. Expected identities were assigned before the gate run, independently of classifiers. Version 2 preserves v1 and appends corporate proxy, API and UI lookalikes before their first execution.",
